of winston and charon both have  obviously turned against jon but whether  they really still work for the high  table is unclear after all the latter  would have sacrificed the continental  and winston without batting an eye it  will also be particularly exciting to  delve deeper into the character of the  bowery king and his empire or rather  what is left of it for one thing should  be clear he and jon can only move in the  shadows now in the trailer akira tracker  and shimazu seem to be on jon's side  mainly because jon and shimasu fight  together against donnie yen as kane who  either works for or with marquise about  the other newcomers unfortunately no  information is known yet director chad  stahelski also spoke a bit about the  plot in the end of the film in an  interview he emphasized that the fourth  film will definitely end on a very  emotional level it will also bring some  story lines to a close this does not  mean that it will be the final part  since in addition to a fifth film a  prequel is also being planned in the  form of the miniseries the continental  we hope to find out more about the plot  soon one thing is for sure though there  will surely be no lack of action  the new movie was already confirmed back  in may 2019 and chad stahlski will once  again take up his position in the  director's chair incidentally he was  kiana reeves stunt double in the first  matrix film and was recently allowed to  be beaten up by trinity in part four of  the sci-fi series as the unpleasant  husband chad thus both the director and  the lead actor share a friendship that  has lasted for years and we think that  shows in the john wick series in  december 2019 reeves began gun foo  training in preparation for filming both  the 4th john wick movie and matrix  resurrections a preview of his progress  could already be seen in the trailer  there was a sequence with donnie yen in  which the two of them showed off the  combination of hand-to-hand combat and  firearms after a long period of delay  shooting them again on june 28 2021 at  studio babelsberg in potsdam as well as  in berlin in paris a mere five months  later filming was officially concluded  it is also known that a fifth part is  already being worked upon lionsgate ceo  john feldheimer announced that the  script has already been in development  since august 2020 stahelski by the way  told the hollywood reporter his secret  for the series success he claimed that  john wick simply has to be made to  suffer in the interview he stated we  keep finding new and interesting ways to  have john wick suffer that's where the  action comes from figure out how to make  him suffer and then design backward in  retrospect this is a very smart approach  alright that was all the latest news  about the fourth part of john wick which  new actor are you looking forward to the  most and how do you think the whole  movie will end let us know in the  comments section and if you like this  video please feel free to give it a  thumbs up see you next time  [Music]

